The decrease in Activision’s net revenues for 2019, as compared to 2018, was primarily due to:
•
lower revenues from the Destiny franchise (reflecting our sale of the publishing rights for Destiny to Bungie in December 2018); and
•
lower revenues from Call of Duty franchise catalog titles.
